{"id":"rancune","lemma":"rancune","pos":"noun","rank":4298,"glosses":["resentment, grudge; rancour"],"ipa":"/ʁɑ̃.kyn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/55/Fr-rancune.ogg/Fr-rancune.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rancunes"},"examples":[{"text":"Il avait une rancune envers moi.","en":"He bore a grudge against me.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"reverse"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Je ne garde pas rancune.","en":"I don't hold grudges.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a watch, guard"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Je n'ai pas de rancune contre toi.","en":"I bear no grudge against you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"against"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Que nous gagnions ou perdions, je n'aurai aucune rancune.","en":"Whether we win or lose, I won't have any hard feelings.","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to win","l":"gagner"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perdre"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]}]}